://imgur.com/u6uA7Yo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/wm2UCet.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Cw074li.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/2j5X6pZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DXcKlJf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/vTsTyrz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mQgIVDu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5xXqhXe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/kVHzJV9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cYHSkb2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/GuGTe3L.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5EiwS3H.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"40\" /><br /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/aHc4S93.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/aK7ykEb.png\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pwwoJoz.png\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/uvtNHb5.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VYJzkYE.png\" width=\"51\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sKvQO1d.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/0bzO6jP.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IyD3iA5.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmLbhkJ.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Just Potion Rings 是一個靈感來自<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-fingers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Potion Fingers</a>的模組，它將每一種生物效果都做成戒指，</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">即使你安裝了會增加更多效果的模組，Just Potion Rings 也會</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">根據新的生物效果新增相應的戒指。</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">請參閱Wiki以獲取：</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/Recipes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">合成配方</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/LootChest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">戰利品寶箱</a> /&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/Trades\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">交易</a> /&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/Commands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">指令</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki#compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">相容性</a>&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/Datapack#how-to-create-a-ring-recipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">如何透過資料包製作戒指配方</a></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/nNw9qcQ.gif\" width=\"413\" height=\"233\" />&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hEo18QI.gif\" width=\"413\" height=\"233\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"34\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>常見問題</strong></span></em></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：我可以將 Just Potion Rings 包含在我的模組包中嗎？</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">答：當然可以，只需將我的模組放入相關的專案中即可。<br /><strong>問：在原版遊戲中，我能獲得多少種戒指？</strong><br />答：在原版遊戲中只有13種戒指可以獲得。請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Wiki</a>了解合成配方及其他獲得戒指的方法。</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：為什麼 Forge 1.21.x 版本的 Just Potion Rings 不可用？</strong><br />答：因為 Curios 尚未有 1.21.x 的版本，詳細原因請看<a href=\"https://github.com/TheIllusiveC4/Curios/issues/427\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">這裡</a>。</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：我要如何為其他藥水效果製作更多配方，它能與其他模組的藥水效果共存嗎？</strong><br />答：你可以透過資料包製作配方，請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Just-Potion-Rings/wiki/Datapack#how-to-create-a-ring-recipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Wiki</a>了解如何製作，並且它確實能與其他模組新增的藥水效果一起運作。</span></p>",
